; Which new-game checkboxes are CAMPAIGNS (mutually exclusive).
;
; This is data about the INSTALLED GAME's screen, not engine knowledge: the
; base screen ships no metadata separating a campaign from a modifier - its
; "РЕЖИМЫ / ОПЦИИ" split is two captions and two x-coordinates - so the
; grouping has to be stated somewhere, and a config is where a statement
; about somebody else's mod belongs. Replace the screen, replace this file.
;
; One REGISTERED CONTROL NAME per line (the name passed to Register() in
; ui_mm_faction_select). A missing control is skipped silently, so this list
; may cover more screens than the one installed. XMS modules are NOT listed
; here - their modes are discovered on the screen automatically.
;
; The current set mirrors the DAR2 РЕЖИМЫ column. The ОПЦИИ column (easy,
; hardcore, rerum, good weapons, good loot) is deliberately absent: those are
; modifiers and stay multi-select. Note the _mode suffix proves nothing -
; hardcore/rerum/easy carry it and are options.
[exclusive_campaigns]
check_survival
check_laststand_mode
check_das_mode
check_warmon_mode
check_metro_mode
check_rev2_mode
check_rev_mode
